ic/tests/e2e/CLAUDE.md:76:| `ironclaw_binary` | Checks `target/debug/ironclaw`; if absent, runs `cargo build --no-default-features --features libsql` (timeout 600s). |
ic/tests/e2e/CLAUDE.md:78:| `ironclaw_server` | Starts the ironclaw binary with a minimal env (see below), waits for `/api/health` (timeout 60s). Yields the base URL. On teardown sends **SIGINT** (not SIGTERM) so the tokio ctrl_c handler triggers a graceful shutdown and LLVM coverage data is flushed. |
ic/tests/e2e/CLAUDE.md:79:| `hosted_oauth_refresh_server` | Starts a second ironclaw instance with a dedicated libSQL DB and `GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=hosted-google-client-id`, while still pointing `IRONCLAW_OAUTH_EXCHANGE_URL` at `mock_llm.py`. Yields a dict with `base_url`, `db_path`, `gateway_user_id`, and `mock_llm_url` for the hosted refresh regression scenario. |
